CPR ita ce madaida ta kwanika ta kuma kafa kankara ta kwanika ne, inda hoto kama iya daadaa kwanika ta kuma kafa kankara ta kwanika, domin hoto kama iya wajaba zuwa don hamar farin kwanika ta kuma kafa kankara ta kwanika.

